{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39701","headline":"二月二日宴中贻同年封先辈渭 · 黄滔","name":"二月二日宴中贻同年封先辈渭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝尧城里日衔杯，每倚嵇康到玉颓。\n桂苑五更听榜後，蓬山二月看花开。\n垂名入甲成龙去，列姓如丁作鹤来。\n同戴大恩何处报，永言交道契陈雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}